DECO Lab — research / non-commercial use

This repository is a research workstation around the DECO paper
(Tripathi et al., ICCV 2023). It is **not** an OSI open-source
redistribution of DECO, SMPL, or MPI checkpoints.

1. Application code in `src/` (UI, Three.js viewer, image-conditioned
   contact estimator, exports) may be used, copied, and modified for
   **non-commercial scientific research, education, or artistic
   projects**, provided this notice and the DECO citation are retained.

2. SMPL geometry and part segmentation under `public/assets/smpl/`
   originate from the official DECO data release. They remain copyright
   Max-Planck-Gesellschaft / MPI-IS and are governed by the DECO Data &
   Software License. See `LICENSES/DECO_LICENSE.md`.

3. Official DECO-HRNet weights (`deco_best.pth`) are **not** included
   and must not be redistributed. Obtain them from the authors under
   MPI terms: https://deco.is.tue.mpg.de/

4. Commercial, military, surveillance, and pornographic use of MPI
   Data & Software is prohibited.

5. Third-party JavaScript packages remain under their own licenses
   (MIT/Apache as declared in `package.json`).

NO WARRANTY. This software is provided "AS IS".

If these terms conflict with the MPI DECO license for MPI materials,
the MPI license controls for those materials.
